-- src:3026 | (1) This Chapter does not affect any requirement for approval by a resolution of the members of a company which applies in relation to the company under Chapter 4.
@ref s 226F(1) Chapter 4 requirements are not affected (src:3026-3026)
`s 226F(1) this Chapter affects a requirement for approval by a resolution of the members under Chapter 4` MEANS
    JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This Chapter does not affect any requirement for approval by a resolution of the members of a company which applies in relation to the company under Chapter 4"

-- src:3027 | (2) Where the making of a payment to which section 226B or 226C applies requires approval by a resolution of the members of the company concerned under Chapter 4, approval obtained for the purposes of that Chapter is to be treated as satisfying the requirements of section 226B(1)(b) or (as the case may be) 226C(1)(b).
@ref s 226F(2) approval under Chapter 4 satisfies sections 226B(1)(b) and 226C(1)(b) (src:3027-3027)
GIVEN `the payment is one to which section 226B or 226C applies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the making of the payment requires approval by a resolution of the members of the company concerned under Chapter 4` IS A BOOLEAN
      `approval has been obtained for the purposes of that Chapter` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 226F(2) the approval obtained for Chapter 4 is treated as satisfying section 226B(1)(b) or 226C(1)(b)` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the payment is one to which section 226B or 226C applies`) OR (NOT `the making of the payment requires approval by a resolution of the members of the company concerned under Chapter 4`)
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the making of a payment to which section 226B or 226C applies requires approval by a resolution of the members of the company concerned under Chapter 4"
        IF `approval has been obtained for the purposes of that Chapter`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "approval obtained for the purposes of that Chapter"
